; LowRider V4 CURRENT AXES: X short / single motor, Y long / dual motor.
; Eight engraved X marks: 550 mm sides and four 550 mm diagonal checks.
; Original geometry retained; no additional X/Y swap or mirror is required.
; Each mark is 10 x 10 mm. Work envelope X5..565, Y5..565, Z-0.25..3.
; Set work X0 Y0 near the lower-left of clear stock; set tool Z0 on its surface.
; Home XYZ first. Provide 13 mm work-Z clearance for the startup pause.
; Manual router only: this file NEVER switches spindle power.
; Feed 600, plunge 60, XY travel 900, retract 180 mm/min.
; ONE PASS ONLY. No G28, G92, M3, M5, or automatic motor disable.
G21
G90
CNC_TEST_PREFLIGHT KIND=SQUARE
M220 S100
LED_ON
START_JOB
G1 Z3.000 F180
M400
RESPOND MSG="550 mm engraving: check work zero, tool and stock. Turn router ON manually at lowest dial; then Resume."
PAUSE
; A center X10.000000 Y10.000000
G1 X5.000 Y5.000 F900
G1 Z-0.250 F60
G1 X10.000 Y10.000 F600
G1 X15.000 Y15.000 F600
G1 Z3.000 F180
G1 X10.000 Y15.000 F900
G1 X5.000 Y15.000 F900
